## D228 §7: a type a trait fixes (Sequence's `Item` is `Cursor.Item`) is not named by a conformance.
import { Has, Not, May } from "std/fallible"
type Deck(cards: Array<Int64>)
conform Deck to Sequence {
    type Cursor = Int64
    type Item = Int64
    fn iterate() -> Int64 {
        0
    }
}
fn main() { 0 }
